{"unit_id":"longguanhong0755__dsh-ssh#card-zh","repo":"longguanhong0755/dsh-ssh","commit":"f8700a62c36637476862258c4735860a86eceacf","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-remote 是面向 DSH Desktop 与 Web 的远程工作区插件，可通过 SSH 连接主机，也支持本机 Windows 上的 WSL 和 Docker 目标。它将远端目录投影到 DSH 原生工作区侧栏，并在远端部署常驻的 DSH Web 运行时。用户可以创建和管理远程项目、查看运行状态、通过本地界面与远端会话交互，也能浏览远程文件。适合希望把 agent 和工具运行在另一台 Linux 主机上的 DSH 用户；首次部署可安装 Node 与 DSH，模型凭证同步为可选。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:35-62","lib/native.js:1-14","lib/remote.js:554-640"]}
{"unit_id":"longguanhong0755__dsh-ssh#card-en","repo":"longguanhong0755/dsh-ssh","commit":"f8700a62c36637476862258c4735860a86eceacf","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ssh-remote connects DSH to remote workspaces over SSH, WSL or Docker. It projects projects into the native sidebar and runs a persistent DSH service on the target. Users can create workspaces, inspect status, chat remotely and browse files. Model credential sync is optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:35-62","lib/native.js:1-14","lib/remote.js:554-640"]}
